[36m(TaskRunner pid=1936665)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1936665)[0m Therefore, the range of the function $y=\log_2 (\sqrt{\sin x})$ for $0^\circ< x < 180^\circ$ is \boxed{(-\infty, 0]}.
