[36m(TaskRunner pid=1936665)[0m Starting with the given equation:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1936665)[0m \[x^2 + 4x + y^2 - 10y + z^2 + 2z + 5 = 0\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1936665)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1936665)[0m We complete the square for each variable:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1936665)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1936665)[0m For \(x\), we have \(x^2 + 4x\), which becomes \((x+2)^2 - 4\).
