[36m(TaskRunner pid=1936665)[0m Factoring the quadratic equation:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1936665)[0m \[(x - 5)(x - 1) = 0.\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1936665)[0m Thus, $x = 5$ or $x = 1$. Checking these solutions in the original equation:
