[36m(TaskRunner pid=1936665)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1936665)[0m \[x^2 + 3y^2 - 4x + 30y - 2 = 0.\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1936665)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1936665)[0m We start by completing the square for both $x$ and $y$ terms.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1936665)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1936665)[0m For the $x$ terms: $x^2 - 4x$, we add and subtract $4$:
