[36m(TaskRunner pid=1936665)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1936665)[0m First, let’s compute $T(b+1) - T(b)$:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1936665)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1936665)[0m T(b+1) = \frac{(b+1)(b+2)}{2}, \quad T(b) = \frac{b(b+1)}{2}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1936665)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1936665)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1936665)[0m T(b+1) - T(b) = \frac{(b+1)(b+2)}{2} - \frac{b(b+1)}{2} = \frac{(b+1)(b+2) - b(b+1)}{2} = \frac{(b+1)(b+2-b)}{2} = \frac{(b+1) \cdot 2}{2} = b+1
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1936665)[0m \]
