[36m(TaskRunner pid=1936665)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1936665)[0m b+1 = \frac{x(x+1)}{2}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1936665)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1936665)[0m We need to find the smallest $b > 2011$, so $x(x+1)/2 > 2012$. We estimate $x$ by solving $x(x+1)/2 \approx 2012$:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1936665)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1936665)[0m x^2 \approx 4024 \implies x \approx \sqrt{4024} \approx 63.43
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1936665)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1936665)[0m Testing $x = 64$:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1936665)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1936665)[0m T(64) = \frac{64 \cdot 65}{2} = 2080
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1936665)[0m \]
