[36m(TaskRunner pid=1936665)[0m \[ A = P \left(1 + \frac{r}{n}\right)^{nt} \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1936665)[0m where:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1936665)[0m - \(A\) is the amount of money accumulated after \(n\) years, including interest.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1936665)[0m - \(P\) is the principal amount (the initial amount of money).
