[36m(TaskRunner pid=1936665)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1936665)[0m \sin^3 2x \cos 6x + \cos^3 2x \sin 6x = \sin 2x \cos 2x (\sin^2 2x \cos 6x + \cos^2 2x \sin 6x).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1936665)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1936665)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1936665)[0m Using the double angle identity $\sin 4x = 2 \sin 2x \cos 2x$, we have:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1936665)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1936665)[0m \sin 2x \cos 2x = \frac{1}{2} \sin 4x.
