[36m(TaskRunner pid=1936665)[0m We need to find the sum of all terms of $B$, i.e., $\sum_{k=1}^{\infty} b_k = \sum_{k=1}^{\infty} 2^{7-2k} = 2^7 \sum_{k=1}^{\infty} 4^{-k}$.
